<title>UK: LucasVarity buys Smiths unit.</title>
<headline>LucasVarity buys Smiths unit.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>British engineering group LucasVarity Plc said on Thursday its Lucas Aerospace division had bought the engine controls business of Smiths Industries Plc for an undisclosed sum.</p>
<p>LucasVarity said the engine controls business designs and manufactures electronic controls for gas turbine engines. It employs around 150 people in Basingstoke, England.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4017</p>
